{"unit_id":"HanKuCha__DSH-Fujiang-Unrestricted#card-zh","repo":"HanKuCha/DSH-Fujiang-Unrestricted","commit":"88ce298a6777939f570ef34ca79c469a6f29a193","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Fujiang Unrestricted 是面向 DSH Desktop 与 DSHA 的工作助手预设和安装包。Windows 安装器将预设与随包技能部署到 DSH Desktop profile，并更新、核对预设依赖和 bundle 配置；移动端提供可导入 DSHA Plugins 的独立 bundle。预设组合了文件与搜索、目标管理、计划模式、技能加载、后台任务、子代理和工作流等工具，适合希望快速配置协作环境的 DSH 用户。桌面安装需使用 Windows 上已启动过的 DSH Desktop 及其 CLI，手机端使用单独的 DSHA 包。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/DSHInstaller.cs:612-694","mobile/cordis.patch.yml:1-25","payload/dsh-ws-helper-preset/cordis.patch.yml:56-80","payload/dsh-ws-helper-preset/cordis.patch.yml:257-293","payload/dsh-ws-helper-preset/cordis.patch.yml:337-432"]}
